{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-yas-park-views","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"yas-park-views-aldar-properties-yas-island","about":"Yas Park Views is a premium residential project by Aldar Properties in the popular resort area of Abu Dhabi - Yas Island. The complex consists of 211 detached villas with 3-5 bedrooms. All residences are designed in a restrained Mediterranean style, and the interior decoration is presented in two versions of design - light and dark. The layout of each of the villas will include a 2-car garage, private pool, an additional bedroom for the maid, a picturesque backyard garden and other amenities. The residential properties at Yas Park View are not only exquisitely designed but also feature high quality finishes using eco-friendly materials and technology. All villas in the community are equipped with high solar reflectance roofs, state-of-the-art ventilation systems and high-efficiency lighting fixtures.The unique collection of villas offers buyers a wide range of services and amenities: private gardens and landscaped areas for strolling, children and adult swimming pools, sports fields and tennis courts, barbecue areas, bicycle paths, organized gym, playgrounds, public recreation areas, skate park, fountains.Within easy reach residents can take advantage of any infrastructure facilities: recreational facilities, restaurants and cafes, stores, entertainment and retail facilities, educational institutions and medical facilities.","price":3889455,"title":"Yas Park Views","bitrix":{"id":550,"pf_id":"are.2.12181","source":null,"project_id":"Yas Park Views","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Yas Park Views","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Yas Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/215/images/2023/6/8/340x252/j0RHK9AGvTjd8jPrHuSmULlxqiW2vsrqGcp6XNBE.webp","464x3